Bugfix: Keep private links available when Sharing API is disabled

On oC10 servers with the Sharing API disabled, the "Sharing" menu item was
hidden entirely, making private links unreachable, since they can only be
accessed via the Sharing view. The Sharing menu item now remains available
whenever the server supports private links. Inside the Sharing view, the
recipients and links sections are shown depending on the Sharing API and
public sharing capabilities, while the private link section is shown
depending on the private links capability.

